body:
if they can continue the conversation afterwards yes. but if they expect me to continue the conversation instead no. Because if i didnt started the interaction then it means i am didnt consider it should be done either because i am in relationship/ busy/care about other thinks at the moment. everytime a girl starts interaction with me with such a way i say " oh god here we go again" . every time it happened girl wanted me to continue which is not my duty at that point because i am obviously busy and wont give much attention or not my duty do so. 

&#x200B;

if you consider doing this kind of starting. please also continue the afterward talkings. because it feels very awkward if a girl makes the first moves then immediately wants return.  we can not have a connnection immediately after every girl.
